# CI evidence is committed explicitly from the workflow, never picked up locally.

# ForgeGradle can decompile Minecraft for inspection. That output is derived from
# Mojang's code and the MCP mappings, so it must never be committed here. The CI
# workflow may still generate it under ci-evidence/ for use within a single run.
ci-evidence/mc-*.java
ci-evidence/gradle-decomp.log
